    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch3-mcq-001",
      "text": "\\(x^2 + 1 = 0\\) এর একটি মূল α হলে \\(|\\alpha|\\) এর মান কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(2\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{-1}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(1\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(x^2+1=0 \\Rightarrow x=\\pm i\\)\n\\(|\\alpha|=|\\pm i|=\\sqrt{0^2+1^2}=1\\)",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 1,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch3-mcq-002",
      "text": "\\(z = 3 - 4i\\) এবং \\(\\sqrt{z} = x + iy\\) হলে নিচের কোনটি সঠিক?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(x^2 - y^2 = 5\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(x^2 + y^2 = 5\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(x^2 + y^2 = 3\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(x^2 - y^2 = 4\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\sqrt{z}=x+iy\\) হলে \\(z=(x+iy)^2\\), তাই \\(|z|=|x+iy|^2=x^2+y^2\\)\n\\(|z|=\\sqrt{3^2+(-4)^2}=5\\)\nঅতএব \\(x^2+y^2=5\\)",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 13,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch3-mcq-003",
      "text": "যদি \\(z = x + iy,\\ z_1 = x_1 + iy_1,\\ z_2 = x_2 + iy_2\\) তিনটি জটিল সংখ্যা হয়, তবে—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "statements": [
        {
          "label": "i",
          "text": "\\(\\mathrm{Re}(z) \\le |z|\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "ii",
          "text": "\\(\\arg(z_1z_2) \\le \\arg z_1 + \\arg z_2\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "iii",
          "text": "\\(|z_1 - z_2| \\ge |z_1| - |z_2|\\)"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "(i) সত্য: \\(\\mathrm{Re}(z)=x\\le\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}=|z|\\)।\n(ii) মিথ্যা: \\(\\arg(z_1z_2)=\\arg z_1+\\arg z_2\\) (২π-এর গুণিতক পর্যন্ত), মুখ্য মানে \\(\\le\\) সর্বদা সত্য নয়।\n(iii) সত্য: ত্রিভুজ অসমতা অনুযায়ী \\(|z_1-z_2|\\ge\\big||z_1|-|z_2|\\big|\\ge|z_1|-|z_2|\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 14,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch3-mcq-004",
      "text": "\\((p + \\bar{p})^2 = \\) কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "stem": "\\(p = \\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(-1 + \\sqrt{-3}\\right)\\) একটি জটিল সংখ্যা।",
      "stem_image": null,
      "group": "higher_math_2nd-2023-BB-15-16",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(1\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(p\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(-1\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\bar{p}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(p=\\omega\\), তাই \\(\\bar p=\\omega^2\\)\n\\(p+\\bar p=\\omega+\\omega^2=-1\\)\n\\((p+\\bar p)^2=(-1)^2=1\\)",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 15,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch3-mcq-005",
      "text": "\\(\\sqrt{p^2 + \\bar{p}^2} = \\) কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "stem": "\\(p = \\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(-1 + \\sqrt{-3}\\right)\\) একটি জটিল সংখ্যা।",
      "stem_image": null,
      "group": "higher_math_2nd-2023-BB-15-16",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(i\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(-i\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(-1\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(1\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(p=\\omega\\) ধরে, \\(p^2+\\bar p^2=\\omega^2+\\omega^4=\\omega^2+\\omega=-1\\)\n\\(\\sqrt{-1}=i\\) (মুখ্য মান)",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
