    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch3-mcq-007",
      "text": "\\(z = 2x + i3y\\) হলে \\(|z| = 1\\) কী নির্দেশ করে?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "বৃত্ত",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "উপবৃত্ত",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "পরাবৃত্ত",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "অধিবৃত্ত",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(z=2x+3yi\\) হলে \\(|z|=1\\Rightarrow 4x^2+9y^2=1\\)\nএটি \\(\\dfrac{x^2}{1/4}+\\dfrac{y^2}{1/9}=1\\) আকারের উপবৃত্ত।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 6,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch3-mcq-008",
      "text": "\\(z = -i + 1\\)—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "statements": [
        {
          "label": "i",
          "text": "z এর মডুলাস \\(\\sqrt{2}\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "ii",
          "text": "z এর আর্গুমেন্ট \\(-\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "iii",
          "text": "\\(z\\bar{z} = z + \\bar{z}\\)"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(z=1-i\\)\n(i) সত্য: \\(|z|=\\sqrt{1+1}=\\sqrt2\\)।\n(ii) সত্য: \\(\\arg z=\\tan^{-1}(-1)=-\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\) (চতুর্থ চতুর্ভাগ)।\n(iii) সত্য: \\(z\\bar z=2\\) এবং \\(z+\\bar z=2\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 7,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch3-mcq-009",
      "text": "\\(\\dfrac{-1 - \\sqrt{-3}}{2}\\) এর মুখ্য আর্গুমেন্ট কত?",
