      "explanation": "\\(z=\\dfrac{(2-3i)(2-i)}{(2+i)(2-i)}=\\dfrac{4-2i-6i+3i^2}{5}=\\dfrac{1-8i}{5}\\)\nঅতএব \\(\\mathrm{Re}(z)=\\dfrac15\\)",
