          "text": "\\(i^{4n} = 1\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "ii",
          "text": "\\((i)^{2n+1} = -1\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "iii",
          "text": "\\((i)^{8n+4} = 1\\)"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "(i) সত্য: \\(i^{4n}=(i^4)^n=1\\)।\n(ii) মিথ্যা: \\(i^{2n+1}=i\\cdot(-1)^n\\), যা \\(\\pm i\\); \\(-1\\) নয়।\n(iii) সত্য: \\(i^{8n+4}=(i^4)^{2n+1}=1\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "DB",
        "year": "2023",
